  "supported_statements": [
    "PQ constant has lower PPL than Hadamard under both asymmetric and symmetric activation quantization in this 8B seed0 experiment.",
    "PQ signed also has lower PPL than Hadamard under both quantizers, so this matrix does not support describing the total PQ improvement as exclusively an affine-offset effect.",
    "Replacing the constant direction by the equally flat signed direction has a larger PPL cost under asymmetric quantization (+0.0278273181) than under symmetric quantization (+0.0029373956), consistent with an additional role for the constant direction when the quantizer includes a groupwise offset.",
    "These are measured directional contrasts, not additive causal contribution percentages."
  ],
  "interpretation_limits": [
    "Single seed 0 point estimates; no seed standard deviation, confidence interval or significance claim.",
    "Activation-only R^T Q(Rx) at post-RMSNorm qkv and down_proj inputs with original BF16 weights/KV; not joint W4A4KV4 or native INT4 deployment.",
